Copyright (c) 2026 Sean Gayle.

This accelerator uses synthetic Maryland-style agency, service, inquiry, and
public-knowledge data for workshop purposes. It is not affiliated with, endorsed
by, or connected to any production State of Maryland system.

The implementation follows workshop-delivery patterns inspired by All Clear,
but it does not copy All Clear's incident-triage domain. Constituent Connect is
limited to non-emergency constituent communications and contact-center support.

Architecture diagrams reference Microsoft Fluent 2 system-icon assets by pinned
package/version metadata documented in design/fluent2-icon-manifest.md.
